  "body": "Automated build of the latest `master`.\n\nThis fork of the mGBA test suite runs every suite automatically on boot\ninstead of waiting at the menu, and reports results over the mGBA debug\nchannel, so emulators can drive it unattended:\n\n```\nBEGIN: <suite name>\nEND: <passes>/<total>\n...\nSKIP: Video tests\nALL DONE\n```\n\n`Video tests` are interactive-only and have no automated runner, so they\nare skipped rather than run.\n\nDownload `suite.gba` below for the current build.\n\nCommit: 2b239cfe63f15ec8ab9cbedb4c09498fc98e7b70 (r101)\n"
